cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "astrovodka: mock resolved HI observations of IllustrisTNG galaxies"
message: >-
  astrovodka has no paper of its own yet. If it contributes to your work,
  please cite the MARTINI papers below — astrovodka is built on the MARTINI
  package and subclasses it — together with the HI/H2 model papers listed in
  the NOTICE file, which are the physics astrovodka implements.
type: software
